# Function type in TypeAssert: [F: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer]]]] is a type alias
# for Integer → Integer. Annotating a lambda with @F enforces (Integer) → Integer.
[
  F: [type [Fn@Integer [Integer]]]
  f: [@F [fn [let n@Integer] n]]
  result: [f 7]
]
=== out
["F": ["Fn": F.Fn  "Integer": F.Integer]  "f": [fn [let n] ...]  "result": 7]
